{
  "name": "local-hitl-review",
  "displayName": "Local HITL Review",
  "description": "Human-in-the-loop local code reviews without needing Draft PRs",
  "version": "0.8.0",
  "publisher": "pablo",
  "license": "MIT",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "https://github.com/pabloubal/local-hitl-review.git"
  },
  "engines": {
    "vscode": "^1.100.0"
  },
  "categories": [
    "Other"
  ],
  "activationEvents": [
    "onView:vscodeComment.changedFiles"
  ],
  "main": "./out/extension.js",
  "contributes": {
    "viewsContainers": {},
    "views": {
      "scm": [
        {
          "id": "vscodeComment.changedFiles",
          "name": "Local HITL Review"
        }
      ]
    },
    "commands": [
      {
        "command": "vscodeComment.refreshChanges",
        "title": "Refresh Changed Files",
        "category": "Local HITL Review",
        "icon": "$(refresh)"
      },
      {
        "command": "vscodeComment.selectBaseBranch",
        "title": "Select Base Branch",
        "category": "Local HITL Review",
        "icon": "$(source-control)"
      },
      {
        "command": "vscodeComment.setFeedbackDir",
        "title": "Set Feedback Directory",
        "category": "Local HITL Review"
      },
      {
        "command": "vscodeComment.initFeedbackWorkspace",
        "title": "Initialize Feedback Workspace",
        "category": "Local HITL Review",
        "icon": "$(new-folder)"
      },
      {
        "command": "vscodeComment.openDiff",
        "title": "Open Diff",
        "category": "Local HITL Review"
      },
      {
        "command": "vscodeComment.showLogs",
        "title": "Show Logs",
        "category": "Local HITL Review"
      },
      {
        "command": "vscodeComment.viewAsTree",
        "title": "View as Tree",
        "category": "Local HITL Review",
        "icon": "$(list-tree)"
      },
      {
        "command": "vscodeComment.viewAsList",
        "title": "View as List",
        "category": "Local HITL Review",
        "icon": "$(list-flat)"
      },
      {
        "command": "vscodeComment.createComment",
        "title": "Add Review Comment",
        "enablement": "!commentIsEmpty"
      },
      {
        "command": "vscodeComment.createCommentWithSuggestion",
        "title": "Add Suggestion",
        "icon": "$(diff)"
      },
      {
        "command": "vscodeComment.insertSuggestionIntoComment",
        "title": "Add Suggestion",
        "icon": "$(diff)"
      },
      {
        "command": "vscodeComment.applySuggestion",
        "title": "Apply Suggestion",
        "icon": "$(check)"
      },
      {
        "command": "vscodeComment.editComment",
        "title": "Edit",
        "icon": "$(edit)"
      },
      {
        "command": "vscodeComment.deleteComment",
        "title": "Delete",
        "icon": "$(trash)"
      },
      {
        "command": "vscodeComment.saveComment",
        "title": "Save",
        "icon": "$(check)"
      },
      {
        "command": "vscodeComment.cancelEdit",
        "title": "Cancel",
        "icon": "$(close)"
      },
      {
        "command": "vscodeComment.setSeverityCritical",
        "title": "🔴 Critical"
      },
      {
        "command": "vscodeComment.setSeverityHigh",
        "title": "🟠 High"
      },
      {
        "command": "vscodeComment.setSeverityMedium",
        "title": "🟡 Medium"
      },
      {
        "command": "vscodeComment.setSeverityLow",
        "title": "🟢 Low"
      },
      {
        "command": "vscodeComment.selectCompareMode",
        "title": "Compare Mode",
        "category": "Local HITL Review",
        "icon": "$(git-compare)"
      },
      {
        "command": "vscodeComment.copyAgentPrompt",
        "title": "Copy Agent Prompt",
        "category": "Local HITL Review",
        "icon": "$(clippy)"
      },
      {
        "command": "vscodeComment.openAllChanges",
        "title": "Open Changes",
        "category": "Local HITL Review",
        "icon": "$(git-pull-request-go-to-changes)"
      },
      {
        "command": "vscodeComment.openCommitChanges",
        "title": "Open Changes",
        "category": "Local HITL Review",
        "icon": "$(git-pull-request-go-to-changes)"
      },
      {
        "command": "vscodeComment.repo.refresh",
        "title": "Refresh Repository",
        "icon": "$(refresh)"
      },
      {
        "command": "vscodeComment.repo.selectBaseBranch",
        "title": "Select Base Branch",
        "icon": "$(source-control)"
      },
      {
        "command": "vscodeComment.repo.selectCompareMode",
        "title": "Change View Mode",
        "icon": "$(git-compare)"
      },
      {
        "command": "vscodeComment.repo.openChanges",
        "title": "Open All Changes",
        "icon": "$(git-pull-request-go-to-changes)"
      },
      {
        "command": "vscodeComment.repo.initFeedback",
        "title": "Initialize Feedback",
        "icon": "$(new-folder)"
      },
      {
        "command": "vscodeComment.file.markViewed",
        "title": "Mark as Viewed",
        "icon": "$(check)"
      },
      {
        "command": "vscodeComment.file.unmarkViewed",
        "title": "Unmark as Viewed",
        "icon": "$(close)"
      }
    ],
    "submenus": [
      {
        "id": "vscodeComment.severityMenu",
        "label": "Change Severity",
        "icon": "$(warning)"
      }
    ],
    "menus": {
      "view/title": [
        {
          "command": "vscodeComment.initFeedbackWorkspace",
          "when": "view == vscodeComment.changedFiles",
          "group": "navigation"
        },
        {
          "command": "vscodeComment.refreshChanges",
          "when": "view == vscodeComment.changedFiles",
          "group": "navigation"
        },
        {
          "command": "vscodeComment.viewAsTree",
          "when": "view == vscodeComment.changedFiles && !vscodeComment.isTreeView",
          "group": "navigation"
        },
        {
          "command": "vscodeComment.viewAsList",
          "when": "view == vscodeComment.changedFiles && vscodeComment.isTreeView",
          "group": "navigation"
        },
        {
          "command": "vscodeComment.openAllChanges",
          "when": "view == vscodeComment.changedFiles",
          "group": "navigation"
        },
        {
          "command": "vscodeComment.selectBaseBranch",
          "when": "view == vscodeComment.changedFiles",
          "group": "navigation"
        },
        {
          "command": "vscodeComment.selectCompareMode",
          "when": "view == vscodeComment.changedFiles",
          "group": "navigation"
        },
        {
          "command": "vscodeComment.copyAgentPrompt",
          "when": "view == workbench.panel.comments",
          "group": "navigation"
        },
        {
          "command": "vscodeComment.copyAgentPrompt",
          "when": "view == vscodeComment.changedFiles",
          "group": "navigation"
        }
      ],
      "view/item/context": [
        {
          "command": "vscodeComment.openCommitChanges",
          "when": "view == vscodeComment.changedFiles && (viewItem == commitItem || viewItem == workInProgressItem)",
          "group": "inline"
        },
        {
          "command": "vscodeComment.openCommitChanges",
          "when": "view == vscodeComment.changedFiles && (viewItem == commitItem || viewItem == workInProgressItem)"
        },
        {
          "command": "vscodeComment.repo.refresh",
          "when": "view == vscodeComment.changedFiles && viewItem == repository",
          "group": "inline"
        },
        {
          "command": "vscodeComment.repo.openChanges",
          "when": "view == vscodeComment.changedFiles && viewItem == repository",
          "group": "inline"
        },
        {
          "command": "vscodeComment.repo.selectBaseBranch",
          "when": "view == vscodeComment.changedFiles && viewItem == repository",
          "group": "inline"
        },
        {
          "command": "vscodeComment.repo.selectCompareMode",
          "when": "view == vscodeComment.changedFiles && viewItem == repository",
          "group": "inline"
        },
        {
          "command": "vscodeComment.repo.initFeedback",
          "when": "view == vscodeComment.changedFiles && viewItem == repository",
          "group": "inline"
        },
        {
          "command": "vscodeComment.file.markViewed",
          "when": "view == vscodeComment.changedFiles && viewItem == changedFileItem",
          "group": "inline"
        },
        {
          "command": "vscodeComment.file.unmarkViewed",
          "when": "view == vscodeComment.changedFiles && viewItem == changedFileItemViewed",
          "group": "inline"
        }
      ],
      "comments/commentThread/context": [
        {
          "command": "vscodeComment.createComment",
          "group": "inline@1",
          "when": "commentController == vscode-comment"
        },
        {
          "command": "vscodeComment.createCommentWithSuggestion",
          "group": "inline@2",
          "when": "commentController == vscode-comment"
        }
      ],
      "comments/comment/title": [
        {
          "command": "vscodeComment.editComment",
          "group": "inline",
          "when": "commentController == vscode-comment && comment == canEdit"
        },
        {
          "command": "vscodeComment.deleteComment",
          "group": "inline",
          "when": "commentController == vscode-comment && comment == canEdit"
        },
        {
          "submenu": "vscodeComment.severityMenu",
          "group": "inline",
          "when": "commentController == vscode-comment && comment == canEdit"
        },
        {
          "command": "vscodeComment.applySuggestion",
          "group": "inline",
          "when": "commentController == vscode-comment && comment == canEdit"
        }
      ],
      "comments/comment/context": [
        {
          "command": "vscodeComment.insertSuggestionIntoComment",
          "group": "inline@0",
          "when": "commentController == vscode-comment && comment == editing"
        },
        {
          "command": "vscodeComment.cancelEdit",
          "group": "inline@1",
          "when": "commentController == vscode-comment && comment == editing"
        },
        {
          "command": "vscodeComment.saveComment",
          "group": "inline@2",
          "when": "commentController == vscode-comment && comment == editing"
        }
      ],
      "vscodeComment.severityMenu": [
        {
          "command": "vscodeComment.setSeverityCritical"
        },
        {
          "command": "vscodeComment.setSeverityHigh"
        },
        {
          "command": "vscodeComment.setSeverityMedium"
        },
        {
          "command": "vscodeComment.setSeverityLow"
        }
      ]
    },
    "configuration": {
      "title": "Local HITL Review",
      "properties": {
        "vscodeComment.feedbackDirectory": {
          "type": "string",
          "default": ".feedback",
          "description": "Directory (relative to workspace root) where .review feedback files are stored"
        },
        "vscodeComment.baseBranch": {
          "type": "string",
          "default": "",
          "description": "Base branch to compare against (e.g. 'main'). Leave empty to auto-detect."
        },
        "vscodeComment.feedbackScope": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "global",
            "local"
          ],
          "default": "global",
          "description": "In a multi-repo session, whether feedback comments are stored globally at the workspace root, or locally in each repository."
        },
        "vscodeComment.defaultCompareMode": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": [
            "branch",
            "commits"
          ],
          "default": "branch",
          "description": "Default view mode when the extension loads: 'branch' (all changes vs base) or 'commits' (graph of commits)."
        },
        "vscodeComment.agentsFile": {
          "type": "string",
          "default": "AGENTS.md",
          "description": "Name of the agents instruction file (inside feedback directory)"
        },
        "vscodeComment.agentsTemplateContent": {
          "type": "string",
          "default": "# Feedback Management\n\nThis directory contains `.review` files (YAML frontmatter + Markdown body) representing code review findings.\n\n## Reviewing Agent\nYou perform adversarial code reviews to find as many issues as possible in the codebase.\n- **New Findings**: Read existing `.review` files first to avoid duplicates. To create a new finding, duplicate the `review_template.md` file in this directory to a new `.review` file (e.g., `<timestamp>-<short_hash>.review`) and fill it out (status: `open`).\n- **Review Pushback**: If an issue has status `acknowledged`, read the pushback in the Markdown body. If you agree, do nothing. If you disagree, change status back to `open` and append your counter-argument.\n\n## Addressing Agent\nYou modify the codebase to address the findings in this directory.\n- **Fix Issues**: For any finding with status `open`, fix the code. Once the issue is addressed and fixed, delete the `.review` file.\n- **Pushback**: If you believe a finding is a false positive, change the status to `acknowledged` and append your explanation.\n\n## How to Reply (Both Agents)\nWhen appending an explanation or counter-argument, **DO NOT overwrite** the existing Markdown body. Append your reply to the bottom, separated by `___` and prefixed with your role:\n\n```markdown\n___\n**reviewing agent**:\nwe need to fix this because...\n___\n**addressing agent**:\nThis is a false positive because...\n```\n",
          "description": "Custom Markdown content to use when creating a new agents file. If empty, the default template is used.",
          "editPresentation": "multilineText"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "scripts": {
    "build": "node esbuild.mjs",
    "watch": "node esbuild.mjs --watch",
    "pretest": "tsc",
    "test:unit": "node --test out/test/*.test.js",
    "test:integration": "vscode-test",
    "test": "npm run test:unit && npm run test:integration",
    "lint": "tsc --noEmit"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@types/mocha": "^10.0.10",
    "@types/node": "^22.20.4",
    "@types/vscode": "^1.100.0",
    "@vscode/test-cli": "^0.0.15",
    "@vscode/test-electron": "^3.1.0",
    "esbuild": "^0.25.5",
    "mocha": "^12.0.2",
    "typescript": "^5.8.3"
  }
}